{"id":"3c8c6546a7f5a867","group":"20","path":"20/20-thm-relative-tot-complete.md","title":"相对 Tot 的 Π₂ 完全性","display":"thm-relative-tot-complete — 相对 Tot 的 Π₂ 完全性","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-thm-relative-tot-complete","aliases":["20-thm-relative-tot-complete"],"display":"thm-relative-tot-complete — 相对 Tot 的 Π₂ 完全性","chapter":"4","section":"4.4.1","source_kind":"book-with-local-formalization","verification_status":"proved-in-note","source_reference":"Theorem 4.3.2 的相对化；Theorem 4.4.2","source_printed_pages":[86,92],"source_pdf_pages":[122,128],"depends_on":["[[20-df-relative-total-index]]","[[20-df-rel-arith]]","[[20-thm-relative-smn]]","[[20-thm-rel-post]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-thm-relative-tot-complete"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-thm-relative-tot-complete</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-relative-tot-complete — 相对 Tot 的 Π₂ 完全性"},{"key":"chapter","html":"4"},{"key":"section","html":"4.4.1"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book-with-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Theorem 4.3.2 的相对化；Theorem 4.4.2"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>86</span><span>92</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>122</span><span>128</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"30a92d1834738e4f\" href=\"?note=30a92d1834738e4f\" title=\"20-df-relative-total-index\">20-df-relative-total-index</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"8251b2f9fd838667\" href=\"?note=8251b2f9fd838667\" title=\"20-df-rel-arith\">20-df-rel-arith</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"8b6134451906e575\" href=\"?note=8b6134451906e575\" title=\"20-thm-relative-smn\">20-thm-relative-smn</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"7315f2111b653872\" href=\"?note=7315f2111b653872\" title=\"20-thm-rel-post\">20-thm-rel-post</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq\\omega\">\\(A\\subseteq\\omega\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"30a92d1834738e4f\" href=\"?note=30a92d1834738e4f\" title=\"20-df-relative-total-index\">20-df-relative-total-index</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"8251b2f9fd838667\" href=\"?note=8251b2f9fd838667\" title=\"20-df-rel-arith\">20-df-rel-arith</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"8b6134451906e575\" href=\"?note=8b6134451906e575\" title=\"20-thm-relative-smn\">20-thm-relative-smn</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"7315f2111b653872\" href=\"?note=7315f2111b653872\" title=\"20-thm-rel-post\">20-thm-rel-post</a>。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Tot}^A\">\\(\\mathrm{Tot}^A\\)</span> 为相对全性指标集，定义见直接上游。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}relative-tot-complete}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Tot}^A\\in\\Pi_2^A\\quad\\land\\quad\\forall B\\in\\Pi_2^A\\ [B\\le_m\\mathrm{Tot}^A]\\quad\\land\\quad\\mathrm{Tot}^A\\equiv_T A\\prime\\prime.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}relative-tot-complete}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Tot}^A\\in\\Pi_2^A\\quad\\land\\quad\\forall B\\in\\Pi_2^A\\ [B\\le_m\\mathrm{Tot}^A]\\quad\\land\\quad\\mathrm{Tot}^A\\equiv_T A\\prime\\prime.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>写 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in B\\leftrightarrow\\forall y\\exists z\\ R^A(x,y,z)\">\\(x\\in B\\leftrightarrow\\forall y\\exists z\\ R^A(x,y,z)\\)</span>，其中矩阵 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 可判定。编译程序在输入 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y\">\\(y\\)</span> 上搜索这样的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"z\">\\(z\\)</span>；它全定义当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in B\">\\(x\\in B\\)</span>。相对 s-m-n 将 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span> 写入代码，得到普通全可计算的索引映射。最后应用相对 Post 定理及跳跃的完全性。</p>\n<p>来源：Theorem 4.3.2 的相对化；Theorem 4.4.2；印刷页 86, 92；PDF 第 122, 128 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-relative-total-index","status":"resolved","id":"30a92d1834738e4f","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-relative-total-index]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-rel-arith","status":"resolved","id":"8251b2f9fd838667","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-rel-arith]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm-relative-smn","status":"resolved","id":"8b6134451906e575","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-thm-relative-smn]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm-rel-post","status":"resolved","id":"7315f2111b653872","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-thm-rel-post]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-relative-total-index","status":"resolved","id":"30a92d1834738e4f","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-relative-total-index]]；see [[20-df-rel-arith]]；see [[20-thm-relative-smn]]；see [[20-thm-rel-post]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-rel-arith","status":"reso